tests of the 1.5840-20 support area notes \uc2 Barclays Capital\uc2 . While this prop holds a return to 1.60 and Friday's 1.6110 peak is likely says the bank. However a daily close below 1.5820 would probably signal a more protracted decline into month end. GBP/USD now at 1.5848. (gary.stride@dowjones.com)\par \par \uc2 0840 GMT [Dow Jones] \uc2 MKB Bank\uc2  expects yields at Hungary's three-month Treasury bill auction to come in at 5.25%-5.30% amid average demand. This compares to 5.24% at the previous auction a week ago. Hungary's debt agency will auction HUF40 billion ($201.7 million) in three-month T-bills, with results due at 0930 GMT. (emese.bartha@dowjones.com)\par \par \uc2 0837 GMT [Dow Jones] China onshore IRS up with curve steepening on step-up in inflation expectations on market view U.S. may take further quantitative easing moves. 1-year steady at 2.15%-2.22%, 5-year +2 bps at 3.09%-3.15%, 1-to-5-year spread 2 bps wider at 93 bps. "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  (PBOC) will hike interest rates some time as the inflation pressure is picking up. So we expect the long-term rates will go higher as if it doesn't hike interest rates now, it will have to hike rates in the future." says Shanghai-based foreign bank trader. (wynne.wang@dowjones.com)\par \par \uc2 0829 GMT [Dow Jones] European sovereign CDS spreads are steady in early trading Tuesday, with the iTraxx SovX Western European index trading little changed at 137.5bps, according to Markit. Ireland is the biggest gainer with its 5-year CDS spreads narrowing 3bps to 395bps, Markit data showed. Meanwhile, Portugal's 5-year CDS spreads are 3bps tighter at 345bps, Italy's are 1bps tighter at 167bps and Spain's CDS are 1bps wider at 199bps. (clare.connaghan@dowjones.com)\par \par \uc2 0827 GMT [Dow Jones] The dollar is in better shape pretty much across the board Tuesday after late comments Monday from US Treasury Secretary Geithner that the US will not encourage devaluation. In Asia the dollar was helped by a less hawkish than expected set of RBA minutes and the Japanese government downgrading its view on the economy, blaming the rising yen and slowing exports. The dollar is up at Y81.40, the euro is down at $1.3918 and the pound is down at 1.5840. (gary.stride@dowjones.com)\par \par \uc2 0827 GMT [Dow Jones] \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's avoidance of \b \highlight22\uc2 FX intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  since last month may be partly due to worries that further action could add to Washington's frustrations. Though U.S. officials mostly quiet, they were unhappy about Tokyo's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  last month as it came at time when they were trying to persuade China to adopt market-oriented \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  rates. This may require Japan to be cautious about acting again; should U.S. begin to openly grumble about Tokyo action, that could weaken impact of potential \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 , as signs of policy split between two nations tend to embolden JPY-buying speculators. Also, \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's September \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  apparently done without U.S. approval, source says; Tokyo lawmakers tried to show leadership to Japanese people irritated by government's inability to stop JPY rises. See \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  Asia: Further \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan Intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  Risks Washington's Ire. (takashi.nakamichi@dowjones.com )\par \par \uc2 0825 GMT [Dow Jones] EUR/\uc2 NOK\uc2  is set to rise further as support at 8.13 is seen spurring further gains, says SEB. EUR/\uc2 NOK\uc2  may move towards tests of 8.1860 and 8.2350, the bank adds, after a "stellar performance" Monday restored a "bullish confidence". EUR/\uc2 NOK\uc2  trades at 8.1710.(charles.duxbury@dowjones.com) [ 10-19-10 0456ET ]\par \par \uc2 4022   \par \par \uc2 Dokument CM00000020101019e6aj0005j\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
