Y\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  TENSIONS GROWING, SEE SIGNS OF PROTECTIONISM \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 South Korea's Minister of Strategy and Finance Yoon Jeung-hyun said Friday that tensions among advanced and emerging economies over \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  rates are growing, and may result in countries setting up trade barriers. (published 0200 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par CHINA'S SEPTEMBER URBAN PROPERTY PRICES UP 0.5% VS AUGUST \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Property prices in 70 of China's large and medium-sized cities rose 0.5% in September from the previous month, and were up 9.1% from a year earlier, the National Bureau of Statistics said Friday. (published 0041 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par PBOC ZHOU: TO CONTINUE TO MANAGE YUAN EXCHANGE RATE BASED ON EXISTING TRADING BAND - REPORT \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 China will continue to manage the yuan's exchange rate based on the existing trading band to maintain the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's basic stability, People's Bank of China Gov. Zhou Xiaochuan wrote in an article in the PBOC-backed magazine China Finance on Friday. (published 0050 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par =UPDATE: FED'S KOCHERLAKOTA: NEW FED ASSET PURCHASES WOULD HAVE 'MORE MUTED' IMPACT \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 A fresh round of asset purchases to stimulate a sagging economy might not help as much as some hope, the president of the \f28 \uc2 \f2 Federal Reserve Bank of Minneapolis\f28 \uc2 \f2  said Thursday. (published 2229 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par DOOSAN MECATEC RAISES KRW264.3 BLN VIA DOOSAN INFRACORE BLOCK SALE - SOURCE \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 South Korean plant builder Doosan Mecatec has raised KRW264.3 billion by selling a 6.03% stake in \f28 \uc2 \f2 Doosan Infracore Co\f28 \uc2 \f2 . via a block sale, a person familiar with the situation said Friday. (published 0057 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par =GRAND JURY INDICTS FORMER CHI MEI EXEC IN LCD PRICE-FIX PROBE \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 A federal grand jury indicted a former Taiwan executive as part of a ongoing antitrust investigation into price fixing on liquid-crystal display panels, the ninth such indictment in the case so far. (published 2320 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par =2ND UPDATE: AMD 3Q LOSS NARROWS ON HIGHER SALES; SEES FLAT 4Q REV \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Advanced Micro Devices Inc\f28 \uc2 \f2 . posted a 16% rise in third-quarter revenue as weak consumer demand for personal computers didn't take as large a toll as feared. (published 2227 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par =2ND UPDATE: SEAGATE EVALUATES SUGGESTION IT GO PRIVATE AGAIN \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 [ 15-10-10 0300GMT ]\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Seagate Technology PLC\f28 \uc2 \f2  said Thursday it has been approached by an unnamed party interested in taking the storage drive maker private, a move that comes as interest in the broad data management sector heats up. (published 0000 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  \par TOP HEADLINES - Indian Media \par India's GMR, JSW Enter Non-binding Bids For Canada's CIC Energy - Business Standard \par India's \f28 \uc2 \f2 Tara Jewels\f28 \uc2 \f2  To Raise INR2 Bln Via Initial Public Offer - PTI \par India's Hydrocarbons Agency Delays Clearing Reliance Industries KGD6 Expenses - Livemint.com \par Bharti Enterprises In Talks With Bank Of India To Sell Bharti AXA Stake - Economic Times \par \f28 \uc2 \f2 Bharti Airtel\f28 \uc2 \f2  To Outsource Customer Support For African \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Operations\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  - Economic Times \par India's ONGC May Partner Winning Bidder For Russian Opil Fields - Economic Times \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 [ 15-10-10 0300GMT ]\f28 \par \par \uc2 62500   \par \par \uc2 Dokument AER0000020101015e6af00005\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
