\par\par \b \uc2 TAKE-A-LOOK- \highlight22\uc2 Currency \highlight\uc2  stand-off entrenched ahead of G20\b0\par\par\uc2 728 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 Oktober 2010\par 14:02\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 G20 nations are under pressure to resolve disputes about \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy or risk a new crisis for the world economy as protectionism takes hold.\par \par \uc2 After a weekend IMF meeting failed to make any headway, Japan questioned South Korea's leadership of the G20 given its \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  to stem the won's rise, U.S. Treasury Secretary Timothy Geithner said he saw "no risk" of a global \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  war but the Federal Reserve said it may ease policy before long, a move likely to weaken the dollar further.\par \par \uc2 G20 finance ministers and \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governors meet in South Korea from Oct. 22 with a leaders summit convening on Nov. 11.\par \par \uc2 Double-click on codes in brackets for stories about the key issues at the meetings. For a diary on the meetings, see [IMF/DIARY]. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  ------------------------------------------------------------------------\par         For a PDF report "\f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 : Race to the bottom"\par                 \f28 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://r.reuters.com/gez77p"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://r.reuters.com/gez77p}}}\uc2 \f2 \par  ------------------------------------------------------------------------\par  MAIN STORY\par > Japan questions S.Korea G20 leadership over \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2        [ID:nTOE69C03K]\par  \par  OTHER LATEST STORIES\par > China \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 FX\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  reserves surge $194 billion in Q3              [ID:nBJB00396